{
    "title": "Fantasy Football My Playbook",
    "description": "Manage your fantasy football lineups and dominate your leagues with My Playbook from FantasyPros.\r\n\r\nMy Playbook is a suite of powerful tools to help you make better decisions, manage your lineups, and win your leagues!\r\n\r\nCreated by FantasyPros, the #1 fantasy sports advice and tools provider in the world, this app will let you import your team to get custom fantasy football news, rankings, and analysis.\r\n\r\nDownload now for the ultimate edge.\r\n\r\n-------\r\n\r\nWhat do you get with My Playbook?\r\n\r\n*Custom Advice*\r\nImport your league for custom news, rankings, and analysis.\r\n\r\n*Breaking News and Updates*\r\nStay on top of the latest player news and expert advice.\r\n\r\n*Accurate Player Rankings*\r\nView consensus rankings from the most accurate experts.\r\n\r\n*Quick Access to Stats & Projections*\r\nTimely research and reports in one convenient spot.\r\n\r\n*In-Depth Expert Analysis*\r\nComprehensive articles, dynamic podcast, and live video streams.\r\n\r\nMore Useful Tools:\r\n\r\n*Start/Sit Assistant*\r\nSee what your optimal lineup is each week based on the most accurate experts. Edit and Submit to your league host with an MVP Premium subscription.\r\n\r\n*Top Available*\r\nIdentify the top fantasy players to pick up in your league.\r\n\r\n*Waiver Assistant*\r\nView suggested players to add and drop.\r\n\r\n*Trade Assistant*\r\nFind out if you should accept or reject a trade.\r\n\r\n*League Analyzer*\r\nSee how your team stacks up against your league.\r\n\r\n*Who Should I Start?*\r\nEasily compare players side-by-side for smart lineup decisions.\r\n\r\n*Game Day*\r\nReal-time fantasy football feed, leaderboard, and league matchups with live fantasy scoring for your teams.\r\n\r\n-------\r\n\r\nNote:  This app supports team imports from the following league hosts:  \r\nYahoo, ESPN, CBS, NFL.com, MyFantasyLeague, Sleeper, FFPC, FFWC, DataForceFF, Fanstar, FleaFlicker, Fantrax, RT Sports, NFC, Reality Sports Online\r\n\r\n-------\r\n\r\nFantasyPros is a leader in the fantasy sports space and has won several awards at the FSTA (Fantasy Sports Trade Association):\r\n\r\n- Best Service/Tool\r\n- Most Valuable Tool\r\n- Most Accurate Projections\r\n- Most Innovative Fantasy Product\r\n- Best New Fantasy Site\r\n\r\n-------\r\n\r\nGot feedback or need help? Visit our help center: https://support.fantasypros.com\r\n\r\nFollow us for ongoing fantasy football updates and hot takes:\r\n- Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/fantasypros\r\n- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/fantasypros/\r\n- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fantasypros\r\n- YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/fantasypros\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.fantasypros.com/about/privacy/\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.fantasypros.com/about/legal/",
